# 7. Three.js Design Principle

Three-dimensional visualization must communicate operational or biological state.

It must not exist merely because 3D looks impressive.

The Living Map should progressively support concepts such as:

```text
Terrain
  ↓
Facilities
  ↓
Sensors
  ↓
Environmental state
  ↓
Threat signals
  ↓
Threat zones
  ↓
Containment zones
  ↓
Response actions
  ↓
Recovery state
```

The exact data, layers, interaction model, and visualization semantics must come from the approved domain, data, UI, and build documents.

Do not invent unsupported biological or operational semantics.

