# 18. Mock Data Policy

Mock data may be used during development where explicitly useful.

However:

**Mock data must never become an accidental second domain model.**

Mock data must conform to the approved data contracts.

When the real data layer is introduced, the UI should consume the same contract shape rather than requiring a rewrite of the feature.

